WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.970
You knew gold would rise? The market disagreed.

00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:09.300
Ego trading: you want to be right instead of making money.

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:13.760
One: spot the warning phrases. It has to turn now.

00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:19.210
Two: the plan was one hundred dollars of risk. Ego makes it six hundred.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:24.270
Three: decide upfront when you're wrong. Then get out, no debate.

00:00:24.320 --> 00:00:28.910
Remember: pros are often wrong. They just don't stay wrong for long.

00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.510
No time to analyze the market yourself?

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:37.780
I show how I handle losing trades live in my free group. Comment GOLD.
